KNN-K Nearest neighbour

K-number of relationships

KNN is calculated based upon the proximity or closeness
This Proximity and closeness is decided by distance algorithm

Distance based metrics/formula
1.Manhatten distance
2.Euclidean distance

This KNN can be used for both classification and regression.

Note:
This is one of the non parametric algorithm.
It is widely for applied for non linear data set.

Parametric is nothing but getting the detail only by its column specific distribution.

Non Parametric never assumes any specific form of data but it checks on overall data range

Elbow method is used to determine K value